00:00:43.752 --> 00:00:44.752
Gadiš mi se.</font></font>

00:00:45.295 --> 00:00:46.695
Gadi mi se što sam ti kći.</font></font>

00:00:47.505 --> 00:00:49.716
Vi ste ljudsko smeće.</font></font>

00:00:50.925 --> 00:00:51.925
