Začepi!</font></font>

00:04:41.614 --> 00:04:42.615
Začepi! </font>-Mama!</font></font>

00:04:43.408 --> 00:04:44.408
Mama!</font></font>

00:04:44.450 --> 00:04:45.827
Natalie ...</font></font>

00:04:45.910 --> 00:04:47.287
Natalie!</font></font>

00:04:48.204 --> 00:04:49.706
Mama!</font></font>

00:04:49.789 --> 00:04:51.374
Uđi! </font>Uđi, dovraga!</font></font>

00:04:51.457 --> 00:04:52.500
Natalie!</font></font>

00:04:52.667 --> 00:04:54.168
Uđi! </font>-Mama!</font></font>

