Spusti to dolje. </font>-Monica.</font></font>

00:40:09.407 --> 00:40:11.117
Već smo dogovorili dogovor.</font></font>

00:40:11.534 --> 00:40:12.734
Nije me briga za vaše dogovore.</font></font>

00:40:12.868 --> 00:40:14.537
Onda ću te morati ubiti, Lidia.</font></font>

00:40:14.870 --> 00:40:16.747
I ubit ću te. </font>Umremo zajedno.</font></font>

00:40:17.039 --> 00:40:19.875
Morate razumjeti. </font>Ne mogu vam reći.</font></font>

00:40:20.334 --> 00:40:21.585
Nije to ništa osobno.</font></font>

00:40:22.294 --> 00:40:23.294
Spusti pištolj!</font></font>

00:40:25.339 --> 00:40:26.339
Monika?</font></font>

00:40:29.176 --> 00:40:32.179
Samo tako možete spasiti svoju kćer.</font></font>

00:40:40.563 --> 00:40:42.231
To je to. </font>Vrlo dobro.</font></font>

00:40:43.524 --> 00:40:44.859
Attagirl. </font>Vrlo dobro.</font></font>

00:40:45.985 --> 00:40:47.027
Dobra cura.</font></font>

00:40:47.987 --> 00:40:48.987
Daniele.</font></font>

00:40:49.530 --> 00:40:50.573
Idemo.</font></font>

00:40:50.781 --> 00:40:51.781
Sanchez.</font></font>

00:40:52.783 --> 00:40:53.783
Što sad?</font></font>

00:40:55.953 --> 00:40:56.996
Ne možete me ostaviti ovdje.</font></font>

00:40:57.580 --> 00:40:58.580
Ako ostanem, sjeban sam.</font></font>

00:40:59.457 --> 00:41:02.793
Dogovorio sam za sebe. </font>Ne mogu dobiti jedan za tebe.</font></font>

00:41:03.878 --> 00:41:04.712
Duguješ mi.</font></font>

00:41:04.879 --> 00:41:06.239
Ne dugujem ti ništa, seronjo.</font></font>

00:41:08.090 --> 00:41:10.009
Vrlo sam dobro platio za vaše usluge.</font></font>

00:41:11.093 --> 00:41:12.470
Znali ste rizike.</font></font>

00:41:13.512 --> 00:41:14.847
Suočite se s posljedicama.</font></font>

00:41:16.223 --> 00:41:17.383
Postoji samo jedna sitnica.</font></font>

00:41:20.144 --> 00:41:21.144
Koji je?</font></font>

00:41:24.190 --> 00:41:25.483
Znam gdje ti je kći.</font></font>

00:41:29.737 --> 00:41:30.737
Sranje!</font></font>

00:41:35.034 --> 00:41:36.034
Monika!</font></font>

00:41:38.162 --> 00:41:38.996
Gdje je ona?</font></font>

00:41:39.079 --> 00:41:41.665
Monika, Monika. </font>-Gdje je moja kći?</font></font>

00:41:41.749 --> 00:41:43.417
Recite joj.</font></font>

00:42:05.356 --> 00:42:06.356
Pončo.</font></font>

00:42:11.529 --> 00:42:12.529
Što je, šefe?</font></font>

00:42:12.738 --> 00:42:13.781
Odvedi me do djevojke.</font></font>

00:42:14.698 --> 00:42:15.741
Šef zna.</font></font>

00:42:17.785 --> 00:42:19.161
Dođi! </font>Pomakni se, seronjo.</font></font>

00:42:19.245 --> 00:42:20.621
U redu, slijedite me. </font>-Sada!</font></font>

00:42:41.308 --> 00:42:42.309
Čisto.</font></font>

00:43:16.427 --> 00:43:18.262
Ostani dolje! </font>Ostani dolje!</font></font>

00:43:18.345 --> 00:43:19.722
Čisto!</font></font>

00:43:53.631 --> 00:43:55.507
PLAČNA PLOČA</font></font>

00:44:02.806 --> 00:44:03.806
Natalie.</font></font>

00:44:05.768 --> 00:44:06.768
Natalie!</font></font>

00:44:07.645 --> 00:44:09.063
Natalia! </font>-Mama.</font></font>

00:44:09.438 --> 00:44:11.607
Natalia, dušo! </font>-Mama!</font></font>

00:44:11.940 --> 00:44:15.486
Pusti! </font>Natalia, dušo!</font></font>

00:44:15.819 --> 00:44:18.030
Moja lijepa djevojka!</font></font>

00:44:20.741 --> 00:44:22.951
Dušo! </font>Dijete!</font></font>

00:44:31.460 --> 00:44:34.838
Amalia, moja djevojčica.</font></font>

00:44:36.298 --> 00:44:38.217
Volim te volim te...</font></font>

00:44:46.600 --> 00:44:47.600
Pete.</font></font>

00:44:48.394 --> 00:44:49.394
Pete!</font></font>

00:44:51.689 --> 00:44:53.065
Eno djevojke.</font></font>

00:44:54.108 --> 00:44:55.150
Održao sam riječ.</font></font>

00:44:56.568 --> 00:44:57.945
Vidimo se, plavušo.</font></font>

00:45:02.408 --> 00:45:05.619
Što je s tobom? </font>Ona je tu, zar ne?</font></font>

00:45:06.203 --> 00:45:09.039
Razgovaram s tobom, seronjo!</font></font>

00:45:09.873 --> 00:45:10.958
Što je...? </font>Pete!</font></font>

00:45:36.733 --> 00:45:37.733
Bok.</font></font>

00:45:49.329 --> 00:45:50.706
Koliko sam dugo ovdje?</font></font>

00:45:51.874 --> 00:45:52.874
Dva tjedna.</font></font>

00:45:55.961 --> 00:45:57.641
Paziš na mene dva tjedna?</font></font>

00:46:00.632 --> 00:46:02.426
Ovo je drugi put da sam ti spasio život.</font></font>

00:46:05.888 --> 00:46:08.765
Sad sam ja ta koja vam ne zna zahvaliti.</font></font>

00:46:11.351 --> 00:46:12.478
Postoji mnogo načina.</font></font>

00:46:50.974 --> 00:46:51.974
Kako si?</font></font>

00:46:58.190 --> 00:46:59.190
Živ.</font></font>

00:47:06.823 --> 00:47:08.450
Mislila sam da neću stići predaleko.</font></font>

00:47:11.328 --> 00:47:15.541
Kladim se da su stvari postale toliko ružne da su završile prilično loše, ha?</font></font>

00:47:21.797 --> 00:47:24.007
Možeš zaboraviti na sva ta sranja.</font></font>

00:47:27.678 --> 00:47:28.678
Bit ćete dobro.</font></font>

00:47:31.932 --> 00:47:33.141
Želim ti pomoći da izađeš.</font></font>

00:47:39.940 --> 00:47:43.652
Hvala, ali mislim da to neće biti tako lako.</font></font>

00:47:44.695 --> 00:47:45.988
Ne poznaješ moju mamu.</font></font>

00:48:01.044 --> 00:48:03.297
Sve ankete govore da ćete pobijediti velikom razlikom.</font></font>

00:48:04.548 --> 00:48:07.718
Pobijedit ćemo. </font>Ovo je bio timski napor.</font></font>

00:48:08.010 --> 00:48:11.013
Hvala svima, stvarno. </font>Odličan posao, momci.</font></font>

00:48:15.100 --> 00:48:19.062
Imamo hranu na konferenciji da vam se zahvalimo na vašem radu,</font></font>

00:48:19.146 --> 00:48:20.856
pa ... hoćemo li?</font></font>

00:48:20.939 --> 00:48:21.939
Da?</font></font>

00:48:25.193 --> 00:48:26.193
Da?</font></font>

00:48:29.448 --> 00:48:31.450
U redu, u redu.</font></font>

00:48:31.700 --> 00:48:32.700
Zbogom.</font></font>

00:48:32.743 --> 00:48:35.454
Alberto, stigao je novi kandidat za tvoju tajnicu.</font></font>

00:48:35.537 --> 00:48:37.577
Zamolio sam je da bude u vašem uredu za pet minuta.</font></font>

00:48:38.498 --> 00:48:39.498
U REDU.</font></font>

00:48:44.171 --> 00:48:45.589
Trebao sam jučer.</font></font>

00:48:47.257 --> 00:48:48.717
Ramirez, zakasnio si.</font></font>

00:48:50.010 --> 00:48:53.805
Vruća kava za mog omiljenog inspektora.</font></font>

00:48:54.723 --> 00:48:57.017
Oprosti. </font>-Hvala vam.</font></font>

00:49:01.688 --> 00:49:05.317
Znate, vrlo je čudno kako kapetan nije ništa rekao.</font></font>

00:49:07.444 --> 00:49:09.071
Nije postavljao pitanja.</font></font>

00:49:11.114 --> 00:49:13.200
Kako ste znali za njegov odnos s Torresom?</font></font>

00:49:13.533 --> 00:49:14.868
Nisam.</font></font>

00:49:15.535 --> 00:49:17.913
Poput tebe slijedio sam svoju intuiciju.</font></font>

00:49:20.666 --> 00:49:21.667
Mislim to.</font></font>

00:49:22.501 --> 00:49:25.837
Blefirao sam, ali čini se da sam bio u pravu.</font></font>

00:49:35.222 --> 00:49:38.725
TI I JA SMO OSTAVILI ZANIMLJIVU PRIČU BEZ KRAJA. </font>ALEX</font></font>

00:49:41.269 --> 00:49:42.269
Je li sve u redu?</font></font>

00:49:45.065 --> 00:49:46.274
Ništa važno.</font></font>

00:49:48.276 --> 00:49:49.653
Mislite da je to bio fotograf?</font></font>

00:49:51.488 --> 00:49:52.906
Ne znam, Velasco.</font></font>

00:49:53.240 --> 00:49:56.827
Opsjednut je smrću i čini se da je i prije ubijao.</font></font>

00:49:58.286 --> 00:49:59.996
Kako znamo da to više neće ponoviti?</font></font>

00:50:01.081 --> 00:50:04.000
Saznat ćemo samo ako se ikad više čujemo s njim.</font></font>

00:50:08.004 --> 00:50:09.004
Polako.</font></font>

00:50:14.845 --> 00:50:15.887
Ramirez!</font></font>

00:50:28.942 --> 00:50:29.942
Ući.</font></font>

00:50:32.028 --> 00:50:33.028
Dobrodošli.</font></font>

00:50:37.325 --> 00:50:38.326
Sjednite, molim vas.</font></font>

00:50:39.828 --> 00:50:40.828
Dobrodošli.</font></font>

00:50:41.538 --> 00:50:42.538
Kako se zoveš?</font></font>

00:50:45.083 --> 00:50:48.170
Moje ime je Elisabeth Molina i imam 19 godina.</font></font>

00:50:49.713 --> 00:50:51.548
Što? </font>O čemu se radi?</font></font>

00:50:52.340 --> 00:50:54.843
Ja sam majka Natalije Saldane.</font></font>

00:51:00.932 --> 00:51:04.186
Oprostite, što želite? </font>Novac?</font></font>

00:51:04.561 --> 00:51:07.189
Upotrijebite veze da dovedete nekoga ovdje iz Meksika.</font></font>

00:51:08.565 --> 00:51:09.565
Zatvorenik.</font></font>

00:51:10.358 --> 00:51:11.359
Javit ću se.</font></font>

00:51:12.235 --> 00:51:15.697
Ako to ne učinite, možete zaboraviti na svoju političku karijeru.</font></font>

00:51:17.407 --> 00:51:19.242
Nadam se da sam se jasno razjasnio.</font></font>

